# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
#  Runtime output -- both programs write their config, console log and every built
#  model / map into an "output" folder beside bin/. None of it belongs in the repo.
#  (config + log are also matched by name in case of a flat / portable install,
#  and *.new covers files staged by a locked in-place update.)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
/output/
mohaa_viewer_config.json
output_console.log
mohaa_map_viewer_config.json
output_console_map.log
*.new

